The fragments in ../fragments/ are ALSO installed to /etc/kernel/config.d/ by
install.sh.  kernel-build.eclass merges /etc/kernel/config.d/*.config as the
last step, after the savedconfig, so the EAC/hardware decisions survive even
if the savedconfig is ever removed or a future version adds new options.
Applying them twice (savedconfig already contains them) is harmless.
